DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
13158::$$$message_0106_0000_0000$$$::Tohsaka's mansion is at the very top of the residential area.[lr]::
13159::$$$message_0106_0000_0001$$$::The owner is away, and Fuyuki's haunted mansion is just that in both name and reality[line len=3][lr]::
13160::$$$message_0106_0000_0002$$$::"...I didn't think I'd have to clean up here."[lr]::
13161::$$$message_0106_0000_0003$$$::I mutter as I look up, in front of the door by myself.[lr]::
13162::$$$message_0106_0000_0004$$$::It can't be helped since Tohsaka, who's traveling to England right now, asked me to come clean up sometimes.::
13163::$$$message_0106_0001_0000$$$::...I think she should at least keep the shutter and door closed during that time, but I should do as I was told.::
13164::$$$message_0106_0002_0000$$$::"Let's get this over with... Umm."[lr]::
13165::$$$message_0106_0002_0001$$$::I get the house key out and recall the incantation to lift the seal.[lr]::
13166::$$$message_0106_0002_0002$$$::The lock is doubled when she's not home, so it's a struggle when someone other than Tohsaka tries to go in.::
13167::$$$message_0106_0003_0000$$$::"Abzug Bedienung Mittelstand[line len=3]"[wvs][sestop time=1500 nowait=true][lr]::
13168::$$$message_0106_0003_0001$$$::[font italic=true]...Did it get lifted?[font italic=false][lr]::
13169::$$$message_0106_0003_0002$$$::I unlock the door [se storage=se511.wav]and take out the mountain of newspapers and letters from the mailbox.[lr]::
13170::$$$message_0106_0003_0003$$$::"Woah, there are so many [wvl][se storage=se521.wav][se storage=se359.wav]attempted delivery notices... She should just forward them to my place."::
13171::$$$message_0106_0004_0000$$$::If I can't get in with this, this would become[line len=3]a big joke.[lr]::
13172::$$$message_0106_0004_0001$$$::No, I bet I'd get scolded by Tohsaka if I told her that I couldn't clean because I couldn't unlock the door.::
13173::$$$message_0106_0005_0000$$$::"Oh[line len=3]it opened, excuse me."::
13174::$$$message_0106_0006_0000$$$::...I'm stunned for a while.[lr]::
13175::$$$message_0106_0006_0001$$$::A room surrounded with expensive-looking antique household furnishing on top of a fluffy carpet.::
13176::$$$message_0106_0007_0000$$$::"Well... Where should I start cleaning from?"[lr]::
13177::$$$message_0106_0007_0001$$$::I'm at a loss for what to do, as someone who is so used to a traditional Japanese-style environment.[lr]::
13178::$$$message_0106_0007_0002$$$::I feel like I'm going to break that totally expensive-looking Art Nouveau light stand if I mess up how to handle it. There's a bunch of those kinds of things all around.[lr]::
13179::$$$message_0106_0007_0003$$$::I regretfully think that I should've brought Sakura, who had gotten used to cleaning the mansion.::
13180::$$$message_0106_0008_0000$$$::"I could've cleaned more efficiently if Rider was here... I'm shorthanded."[lr]::
13181::$$$message_0106_0008_0001$$$::I should at least be able to ventilate and brush away the dust.[lr]::
13182::$$$message_0106_0008_0002$$$::I go around the room and open the shutters [se volume=30 storage=se263.wav]and the windows.[lr]::
13183::$$$message_0106_0008_0003$$$::Hmm, it's dusty after all[line len=3]::
13184::$$$message_0106_0009_0000$$$::"All right... The cleaning tools are downstairs."[lr]::
13185::$$$message_0106_0009_0001$$$::There should be a cupboard under the stairs.[lr]::
13186::$$$message_0106_0009_0002$$$::Come to think of it, Tohsaka was saying something horrible like I could live in the cupboard under the stairs if I become her live-in apprentice... That's like how you would treat a maid or a genius boy mage or something.::
13187::$$$message_0106_0010_0000$$$::"All right, I should give it a try[line len=3]"[lr]::
13188::$$$message_0106_0010_0001$$$::I brush away the dust.[lr]::
13189::$$$message_0106_0010_0002$$$::Rather than cleaning, [se volume=50 storage=se312.wav][se volume=50 storage=se190.wav]it's like I'm sightseeing while holding a duster.::
13190::$$$message_0106_0011_0000$$$::"Oh yeah, there's a basement[line len=3]"[lr]::
13191::$$$message_0106_0011_0001$$$::I look through the bundle of keys and[line len=3]find the basement key.[lr]::
13192::$$$message_0106_0011_0002$$$::Western-style mansions are so luxurious, having a basement.[lr]::
13193::$$$message_0106_0011_0003$$$::There would be a wine cellar or something in the basement in the mansions that appear in movies or books.[lr]::
13194::$$$message_0106_0011_0004$$$::...As I wonder what will happen if there's a dungeon...::
13195::$$$message_0106_0012_0000$$$::"...Here it is."[lr]::
13196::$$$message_0106_0012_0001$$$::Even if I pretend that it's something like the shed at my house, I nervously hold my breath from the mysterious and secretive atmosphere.[lr]::
13197::$$$message_0106_0012_0002$$$::I'm also deeply moved when I think that Tohsaka also...::
13198::$$$message_0106_0013_0000$$$::But, what catches my eye more than that...[lr]::
13199::$$$message_0106_0013_0001$$$::"There are dumbbells here, it's weirdly..."[lr]::
13200::$$$message_0106_0013_0002$$$::I wonder why this sort of stuff would be down here.[lr]::
13201::$$$message_0106_0013_0003$$$::It's hard to say whether there's training equipment or not.[lr]::
13202::$$$message_0106_0013_0004$$$::Come to think of it, Tohsaka said she was doing push-ups or sit-ups every night. Maybe eventually various devices got brought in like a gym...::
13203::$$$message_0106_0014_0000$$$::"...I guess she wouldn't do that much."[lr]::
13204::$$$message_0106_0014_0001$$$::Dumbbells don't match Tohsaka's room, so she must have brought them here.[lr]::
13205::$$$message_0106_0014_0002$$$::But... I feel like I saw something that I shouldn't be seeing more than the inside of her dresser.::
13206::$$$message_0106_0015_0000$$$::"...Well, I guess I'll leave this how it is."[lr]::
13207::$$$message_0106_0015_0001$$$::I decide not to look around.[lr]::
13208::$$$message_0106_0015_0002$$$::I'll close up after ventilating and retreat early.::
13209::$$$message_0106_0016_0000$$$::"Anfung Mittelstand[line len=3]"[wvs][sestop time=1500 nowait=true][lr]::
13210::$$$message_0106_0016_0001$$$::...I got worried again about whether or not I closed it properly.[lr]::
13211::$$$message_0106_0016_0002$$$::I need to get better at magecraft, or else it'll make me worried about the future.::

